window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>🩸 VEIL OF BLOOD </b><b>🩸</b><p>I never planned to look back.<br>Never meant to get caught up in this world.<br>But the past doesn’t let go—it bleeds, staining everything in its path.</p><p>Miami’s underworld runs on power, speed, and deception.<br>And I know better than to trust anyone.<br><b>Especially Rocco Damiani</b>—a brutal enforcer with a soldier’s discipline and a sinner’s soul.<br>He’s the last person I should rely on.<br>But when a high-stakes heist puts us on the same side,<br>I have no choice but to play his game.</p><p>The cash we stole hides more than secrets—<br><b>It holds the key to my brother’s murder.</b><br>And the deeper we go, the clearer it becomes...</p><p><i>’m not the only one out for blood.</i><br><i>He’s a weapon. I’m a spark.</i><br>T<i>ogether, we could burn this city down—</i><br><b>Or end up in the flames ourselves.</b></p>"; 
